  "question": {
    "text": "What volume of hydrogen gas, at $273 \\mathrm{~K}$ and $1 \\mathrm{~atm}$, pressure will be consumed in obtaining $21.6 \\mathrm{~g}$ of elemental boron (atomic mass $=10.8$ ) from the reducti on of boron trichloride by hydrogen?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
